            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Edição especial</h1><p>The game includes the Soundtrack, the Art Book, and the Fan Book. Everything can be accessed through a beautiful launcher where you will have all features!</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PEOPLE HAVE MANY THINGS PENT UP INSIDE OF THEMSELVES...SO MANY THINGS THEY WANT TO FORGET...</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/464670/extras/0ca84441e5da4e1b72d58435d605d213.avif?t=1667224988\" width=500 height=250 /></span><br><br><strong>EMPTY SOUL</strong> takes you into the story of Solan Walls, a young scientist girl who suffered a terrible accident. Due to that fact, she started to experience creepy nightmares...What Solan doesn't know is that all her pain and dreams are somehow connected!<br><br>Her mission is to reach the end of the horror, while surviving from all kind of enemies.<br>She'll find allies along the way, but... can you trust something that your mind created?<br><br>“This is something more, it's not only on her mind...”<br><br>Face the fear in this horror indie game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2>•\tIntriguing story and animated sequences.<br>•\tClassic style 2D graphics.<br>•\tNew gameplay system! Inspired by the best Survival Horror titles!<br>•\tCombine items in order to continue!<br>•\tPlayer's emotions that affect gameplay and story!<br>•\tSteam achievements to unlock!<br>•\tTrading Cards!<br>•\tSecrets to discover!<br>•\tPuzzles to solve!<br>•\tCompletely new &quot;Gallery&quot; with artwork from the game!<br>•\tArtbook and FanBook available!<br>•\tSoundtrack available!<br>•\tEmotive and intriguing music for every moment!<br>•\tCloud Save Feature!<br>•\tA classic 4 chapters game! (Additional Chapter coming soon!)",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PEOPLE HAVE MANY THINGS PENT UP INSIDE OF THEMSELVES...SO MANY THINGS THEY WANT TO FORGET...</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/464670/extras/0ca84441e5da4e1b72d58435d605d213.avif?t=1667224988\" width=500 height=250 /></span><br><br><strong>EMPTY SOUL</strong> takes you into the story of Solan Walls, a young scientist girl who suffered a terrible accident. Due to that fact, she started to experience creepy nightmares...What Solan doesn't know is that all her pain and dreams are somehow connected!<br><br>Her mission is to reach the end of the horror, while surviving from all kind of enemies.<br>She'll find allies along the way, but... can you trust something that your mind created?<br><br>“This is something more, it's not only on her mind...”<br><br>Face the fear in this horror indie game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2>•\tIntriguing story and animated sequences.<br>•\tClassic style 2D graphics.<br>•\tNew gameplay system! Inspired by the best Survival Horror titles!<br>•\tCombine items in order to continue!<br>•\tPlayer's emotions that affect gameplay and story!<br>•\tSteam achievements to unlock!<br>•\tTrading Cards!<br>•\tSecrets to discover!<br>•\tPuzzles to solve!<br>•\tCompletely new &quot;Gallery&quot; with artwork from the game!<br>•\tArtbook and FanBook available!<br>•\tSoundtrack available!<br>•\tEmotive and intriguing music for every moment!<br>•\tCloud Save Feature!<br>•\tA classic 4 chapters game! (Additional Chapter coming soon!)",
            "short_description": "EMPTY SOUL takes you into the story of Solan Walls, a young scientist girl who suffered a terrible accident. Now she must escape from horrible nightmares. Face the fear in this horror indie game!",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong>, Espanhol (Espanha), Espanhol (América Latina)<br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
            "reviews": {
